---
title: Sphinx ATL Topology Extension Architecture
---
graph TB
    subgraph "Sphinx Integration"
        Setup[setup function<br/>Extension Entry Point]
        SphinxApp[Sphinx Application]
    end

    subgraph "Directive Processing"
        Directive[TopologyDiagramDirective<br/>RST Directive Parser]
        Schema[schema.py<br/>validate_topology]
        DeviceTypes[device_types.py<br/>classify_device<br/>DEVICE_TYPE_ICONS]
    end

    subgraph "Document Tree"
        Node[TopologyDiagramNode<br/>Custom Docutils Node]
        Translator[translator.py<br/>visit_topology_node<br/>depart_topology_node]
    end

    subgraph "HTML Output"
        HTMLDiv[data-topology Container<br/>JSON Configuration]
    end

    subgraph "Static Assets"
        CSS[atl-topology-viewer.css]
        CytoscapeJS[cytoscape.min.js]
        DagreJS[cytoscape-dagre.js]
        ViewerJS[atl-topology-viewer.js]
    end

    subgraph "Client-Side Viewer"
        ATLViewer[ATLTopologyViewer<br/>Auto-initializing]
        ViewerManager[ViewerManager<br/>Cytoscape Rendering]
        EventHandlers[ViewerEventHandlers<br/>SSH/Console/Focus]
        StatusUpdater[ViewerStatusUpdater<br/>WebSocket Status]
        ZoneRenderer[ViewerZoneRenderer<br/>Zone Helpers]
        AnnotationRenderer[ViewerAnnotationRenderer<br/>HTML Overlays]
    end

    Setup -->|register| SphinxApp
    SphinxApp -->|add_directive| Directive
    SphinxApp -->|add_node| Node
    SphinxApp -->|add_css_file| CSS
    SphinxApp -->|add_js_file| CytoscapeJS
    SphinxApp -->|add_js_file| DagreJS
    SphinxApp -->|add_js_file| ViewerJS

    Directive -->|validate| Schema
    Directive -->|classify devices| DeviceTypes
    Directive -->|create| Node

    Node -->|HTML translation| Translator
    Translator -->|generate| HTMLDiv

    HTMLDiv -.->|rendered in browser| ATLViewer
    CSS -.->|styles| ATLViewer
    CytoscapeJS -.->|graph engine| ATLViewer
    DagreJS -.->|layout| ATLViewer
    ViewerJS -.->|initializes| ATLViewer

    ATLViewer --> ViewerManager
    ATLViewer --> EventHandlers
    ATLViewer --> StatusUpdater
    ATLViewer --> ZoneRenderer
    ATLViewer --> AnnotationRenderer

